# www -> apex. The canonical tag on every page is https://mev-x.com/, so www
# must not serve a second copy of the site.
# If this does not take effect, do it as a Redirect Rule in the Cloudflare
# dashboard instead (Rules -> Redirect Rules) — that path is guaranteed.
https://www.mev-x.com/* https://mev-x.com/:splat 301
